WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Ryu blocks the standing LP before his recorded Shoryuken.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.950
Marisa guards the recorded reversal.

3
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:02.950
Held crouching HP punishes the reversal recovery.

4
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.350
A second held crouching HP continues the juggle.

5
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.250
Raw Drive Rush reaches crouching MP under the airborne Ryu.

6
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.450
Crouching MP cancels into Drive Rush and the forward-HK target.

7
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:09.250
Held crouching HP picks up the next juggle.

8
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.650
Held Level 1 Super finishes with the recorded hard knockdown.
